# Cripple Creek: traditional Appalachian song (collected 1918).
{title: Cripple Creek}
{composer: Traditional (Appalachian)}
{key: A}
{tempo: 120}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 1}
{x_strum: D - D - D - D -}

